  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK contribution to EBRD&apos;s Ukraine Reconstruction Guarantee Facility (URGF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ukraine Reconstruction Guarantee Facility (URGF), developed by the European Bank of Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) and co-funded by the UK and other bilateral donors will support the development of insurance products that will be available to all companies operating in Ukraine and be issued by local insurers. This complements the UKs support to the Multilateral Investment Guarantee Agency&#x2019;s (MIGA) Ukraine Reconstruction Trust Fund (&#x201c;SURE TF&#x201d;) in 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
